      },
      {
        "kind": "tool",
        "tool": "web.run",
        "call": "Fetch https://www.bea.gov/news/schedule and https://www.bea.gov/news/2026/personal-income-and-outlays-august-2026.",
        "result": "The official calendar schedules September 2026 Personal Income and Outlays for October 29, 2026, at 8:30 a.m. EDT, corroborated by August's next-release announcement. August core PCE was 0.2% month over month and 3.0% year over year; July's revised monthly value was 0.1%."
      },
      {
